title: On walking the same mile for a year
date: 2026-10-15
author: June Okafor
excerpt: Repetition isn't boring if you let the mile change you instead of the other way round.
image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494809610410-160faaed4de0?w=1600&q=80
